  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS -10382 GBFF PPG Establishing and protecting major river buffer zones in Vanuatu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GBFF Project Preparation Grant (PPG) is to develop the project concept into a full project for establishing and protecting major river buffer zones in Vanuatu. This initiative aims to enhance the ecological health and sustainability of the Jordan, Brenwe, Talise, Sarakata, and Melsisi rivers through improved governance, the establishment of effective river buffer zones, and community engagement in water resource management, ensuring their protection and restoration for current and future gen</narrative>
  </description>
